// NON-PAPER adapter: four 1k resistors average main and side differential inputs. Fig3 side-terminal function absent in Fig2; disclosed executable hypothesis, not paper-exact.
subckt ota_side_sum_assumption VIP VIM SUMP SUMM VOP VOM VT VREF VDD GND
RIP (VIP GP) resistor r=1k
RSP (SUMP GP) resistor r=1k
RIM (VIM GM) resistor r=1k
RSM (SUMM GM) resistor r=1k
CORE (GP GM VOP VOM VT VREF VDD GND) ota_fig2_interpreted 
ends ota_side_sum_assumption
// Four physical OTA cores and C1-C4. Fig3 side feedback realized by explicitly non-paper passive input-summing adapters. No fourth-order accuracy claim. All capacitor values derived once from gm/(2*pi*15MHz).
subckt filter_fig3_reconstruction VIP VIM VOP VOM VT VREF VDD GND
OTA1 (VIP VIM BM BP AP AM VT VREF VDD GND) ota_side_sum_assumption 
OTA2 (AP AM BP BM VT VREF VDD GND) ota_fig2_interpreted 
OTA4 (AP AM DM DP VOP VOM VT VREF VDD GND) ota_side_sum_assumption 
OTA3 (VOP VOM DP DM VT VREF VDD GND) ota_fig2_interpreted 
C1 (BP GND) capacitor c=7.65804778642e-12
C2 (BM GND) capacitor c=7.65804778642e-12
C3 (DP GND) capacitor c=7.65804778642e-12
C4 (DM GND) capacitor c=7.65804778642e-12
ends filter_fig3_reconstruction
